00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:05.980
Koikimo

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:10.980
Episode 2

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:10.980
"He Smelled Like Cologne"

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:14.440
I'm... home?

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:16.200
Ryo-san?

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.900
Wh-Why...

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:22.340
is Ichika-san in my home, wearing an apron...

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.300
and welcoming me back?

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.040
Well, actually...

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:29.690
I never thought I'd start 
daydreaming from exhaustion...

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:30.710
Uh, hello?

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.510
Wait, did I turn in our marriage 
registration without realizing it?!

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:36.020
Of course not!

00:02:36.730 --> 00:02:38.590
Hey, welcome back, Onii-chan.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.050
Oh, good evening.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.800
Hello.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.300
This is Satsuki and Ruri from my class.

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:47.200
Good evening.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:50.370
We're borrowing your kitchen. 
I hope you don't mind.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:52.810
We couldn't get our culture
festival prep done at school,

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:54.720
so they all came over.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.110
I see. What are you guys doing?

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.950
A Japanese-style café.

00:02:58.950 --> 00:03:02.170
We were making the cookies that 
we want to serve at the event.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.370
Looks like you're all working hard.

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:05.850
Great job.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.620
Th-Thank you very much.

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:14.380
<i>Who the heck is this smooth criminal? 
Is this one of his womanizer skills?!</i>

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.180
Hey, why don't we hang out in my 
room until the cookies are cool?

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.920
We can sample the chiffon 
cake we made earlier.

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.020
Oh, sure.

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:23.390
Right on!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.670
I'll head up to my room.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.100
Yeah, sure.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.650
Enjoy your stay.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:36.070
<i>Newlywed housewife Ichika-san 
wearing an apron is awesome!</i>

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:39.320
Oh my God! Your brother's super hot, Rio!

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.810
You can totally tell how mature he is!

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:44.950
The boys at school don't stand a chance!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.550
He's tall and looks amazing 
in a suit, and to top it off,

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:47.100
Yeah, yeah!

00:03:47.550 --> 00:03:50.620
that suit looks expensive, 
but he doesn't seem snobbish at all!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.250
Yeah, yeah!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:54.830
Actually, it's like he's doing the suit 
a favor by wearing it! He's so refined!

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:54.030
Yeah, yeah!

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:58.760
Hey, I thought Ryo-san wasn't 
supposed to be here today.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.900
Well, I could've sworn he said he'd be home late.

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:03.900
My bad.

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.510
Those two have totally fallen 
under Ryo-san's spell...

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:11.870
Hey, don't you think Rio's brother's 
a total hottie, too?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.520
Huh? I, uh...

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:19.220
I can totally see him being in some men's 
fashion magazine wearing something fancy!

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:20.400
Right?

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:24.590
Personally, I think he'd look amazing 
in a white tuxedo or a garçon outfit!

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:26.090
He'd look great cosplaying a doctor, too.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:29.870
Nice! Excellent! I have to put a vote in 
for traditional Japanese clothes, too.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.910
Perfection.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:34.520
What do you think he'd look good in, Ichika?

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:35.500
Huh?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.640
This again? Um...

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:42.830
I guess if I absolutely had 
to choose, I'd say a suit...

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:46.820
Rio, how much older is your brother?

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:49.440
Uh... Ten years, I think?

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.600
Wow, that's quite an age gap. 
You guys seem close, though.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:56.490
I have siblings, too, 
but we're always fighting.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.440
Hmm...

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.720
I didn't actually like him that much before.

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:01.570
Huh?

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:04.150
That was in the past, though.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:08.700
I didn't really talk to him much when 
I was in grade school or middle school.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.090
There was a period when he was 
somewhat of a troublemaker, too.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.660
Who the hell was that woman?

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.700
It's not like I want her around, either.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:19.960
This is all because you're so irresponsible!

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:21.120
Oh, please!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.670
Stop bringing trouble home!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.000
It was probably pretty noisy earlier, huh?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:33.940
What was?

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:36.080
Downstairs. Dad and I.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:39.310
I had my earphones in with music on, 
so I didn't hear anything.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.480
Good to know.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.360
If you're worried about that...

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.400
then just don't argue.

00:05:55.610 --> 00:05:56.900
So annoying...

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.250
After he left home, we hardly saw each other.

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:05.580
But lately, he's been coming home more often,

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:09.000
and now, we have a lot more to talk about.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:13.900
Yeah?

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:14.690
Rio!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:15.360
Huh?!

00:06:15.360 --> 00:06:18.770
Tell me all about Ichika-san! 
When's her birthday? What're her hobbies?!

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:20.690
Oh, no! Does she have a boyfriend?!

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:28.910
What's so funny?

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:32.160
Nothing, you just sounded 
so desperate... Sorry.

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:36.450
I'm not sure if that's why, 
but he seems like a better guy.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:38.330
We get along pretty well now.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.260
Aw, really? I'm so jealous.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:42.920
Yeah?

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.700
What's up?

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.310
Here, enjoy these with the sweets you made.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.890
Oh, thanks.

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.830
Oh, you didn't have to.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.560
Thank you so much.

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.600
<i>I had no idea Rio felt that way.</i>

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.850
Oh, just make sure Ichika-san gets this one.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.360
Hm? Oh, yeah. Sure.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.320
Here you go.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.490
Thanks.

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:09.700
Oh?

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.160
Look, it's latte art.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.700
Wow, it's so cute!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.370
Mine's a cat.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.980
Mine's a bunny.

00:07:17.980 --> 00:07:19.660
This one's yours, Ichika.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.010
Thanks.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.840
<b>Ichika-san</b>

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.180
What did you get, Ichika?

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:29.810
Wait, you stirred yours up already?!

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:33.270
Oh, whoops. I wasn't thinking. 
It was, uh... an armadillo! Yeah!

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.390
An armadillo?

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.730
Wow, I wish I could've seen it!

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.230
Thanks for having us over.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:46.700
I should really walk Ichika-san home—

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:50.720
Thanks, Rio.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:51.970
Huh?

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:56.190
You didn't tell Ichika-san 
I'd be coming home.

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:57.450
Oh, yeah.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:08:01.560
And because of that, I got 
to see her in an apron.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:03.060
You're welcome.

00:08:04.950 --> 00:08:05.740
But...

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:11.970
If you do anything to make Ichika sad, 
I won't support you anymore,

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:13.900
even if you are my brother.

00:08:18.700 --> 00:08:20.330
I'll keep that in mind.

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.330
Welcome.

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:32.780
You already started drinking? Rude.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:36.300
Please. You're the one who was late, Masuda.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:39.290
Yeah, yeah, sorry about that.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.300
Oh, could I get what he's having?

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:45.330
So how's work going, Acting Section Chief?

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:46.750
Fine, I guess. Nothing's changed.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:49.740
Introduce me to a cute girl from your work.

00:08:49.740 --> 00:08:52.180
And what's going on with you, 
freelance photographer?

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:53.360
Huh? Me?

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.500
You'd be surprised how popular 
you get when you say

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.580
that you've shot photos in Paris, my guy.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.600
Huh...

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:05.480
Though that trip was actually for a 
photobook called <i>Belly Wraps Around Europe</i>.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.790
Oh, I quit.

00:09:07.790 --> 00:09:09.400
Huh? When?

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.590
Just recently.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.590
Why? Health reasons?

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.650
Not exactly.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:17.220
I basically quit for someone 
else, not for myself.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:22.740
So, hey... I've been hearing some rumors.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:24.880
Is it true you're messing 
with a high school girl?

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.720
Where the hell did you hear that?

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:32.190
Wait, it's true? Way to go, Ryo-san!

00:09:32.190 --> 00:09:34.660
Well, I'm not actually messing with her.

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:35.670
It's still, uh...

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.550
a crush on my part.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.890
What kind of reaction is that?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.140
You... have a crush...

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:46.050
on a high school girl?

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.280
Yeah, so?

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:51.410
The womanizer with nothing but his looks
going for him, who's never asked a girl out?

00:09:51.410 --> 00:09:52.360
Shut up.

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:53.960
Did you hear that, boss?!

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:56.660
He has a c-c-crush on someone! 
We have to celebrate!

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.880
Red bean rice! We need red bean rice!

00:09:58.880 --> 00:09:59.980
Sure, coming right up.

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:01.050
Wait, you <i>have</i> some?!

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.280
What is your deal?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:06.880
So, where's her pic? I'm sure you have one.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.760
I'd rather die than show you. 
You'll sully her.

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:14.560
Miser. Then how'd this happen? 
How did you two meet?

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.650
I almost died, and she saved me.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.910
Squee! OMG, that's like some TV drama!

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.810
Wait, she saved you, though?

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:27.170
Not only that. She gave me, a total stranger, 
her lunch because I was feeling woozy.

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:27.780
Huh?

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:38.400
Deary me, aren't you handsome? 
Would you like my lunch?

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:31.470
Sounds like the old lady on the train 
who gives you a piece of candy.

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.490
Don't you dare compare her to that!

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.810
So then we coincidentally 
bumped into each other again,

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:38.400
and I told her that I wanted 
to repay her for saving me.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:42.530
Oh, I get it. You offered your body to her.

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:46.960
Wait, you actually did? 
That's beyond yikes, my dude.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:48.450
And then she said,

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:53.750
"You're creepy. What are you thinking?"

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.670
Well, damn. I guess she doesn't hold back.

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:57.590
Yeah...

00:10:57.900 --> 00:11:00.550
Then, I dunno... Yeah.

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:03.180
I realized I liked her, I guess.

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:05.180
Ryo...

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:08.100
Have you always been a masochist?

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.170
Who knows?

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:15.580
But I mean, she saved your 
life and gave you her lunch?

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:16.190
Right.

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:19.470
And everything you've done 
to girls up to this point

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:21.830
isn't working with this girl.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:26.200
Which just made you feel like, 
"Oh, this girl's sorta amazing. I like her."

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:28.950
Could be...

00:11:29.390 --> 00:11:33.900
I mean, it's possible that I just
now realized I'm into that...

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.630
I've never felt like this before.

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.970
I honestly... don't get it myself.

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.530
Squee...

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.070
Okay, why do you keep doing that?

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:47.220
Wh-Wh-What even is going on?! 
I'm starting to feel embarrassed for you!

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.730
This is so bittersweet! 
It's like a cassis orange!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:52.450
Boss, give me a cassis orange!

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:53.730
Sure, coming right up.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:55.860
Man...

00:11:55.860 --> 00:12:00.920
I've known you since middle school, 
but I've never seen this side of you.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:04.380
Hey, Ryo. Let's go to karaoke today.

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:05.860
Come on, come on!

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:08.410
You know, you could at 
least answer the poor girl.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.920
Hey, Ryo. Want to come over today?

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:14.140
No, come over to my place. Come on, please?

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:16.390
You seriously don't change.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:23.300
Oh, I'm <i>so</i> going to cheer 
you on! It's on me tonight!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.430
Why are you talking like that?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:28.380
So, how are you trying 
to get her to like you?

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.310
Nothing special.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:32.940
Well, let's see...

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:34.810
I've been sending her flowers every day,

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.450
sending her gifts from my 
business trip locations...

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:41.390
Oh, and I've sent her gift 
baskets of stuff she likes,

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:44.930
and I sent her the result from when I got 
her fortune read with my last name...

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.450
Um... What?

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:48.120
And then...

00:12:48.460 --> 00:12:51.410
Her disgusted reactions to all 
that are the cutest thing ever.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.150
A-Ah...

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:57.210
<i>Looks like this crush also awakened 
something super weird within him.</i>

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:00.180
Hey, I know! Let's give this girl a call!

00:13:00.180 --> 00:13:00.620
Huh?

00:13:00.620 --> 00:13:02.800
I wanna hear what she sounds like! 
Let me see your phone!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.190
Hey, give that back.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:08.170
Come on, I'll say nice things 
about you. I'm your bud, after all!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.760
She's in my contacts as "Ichika-san."

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:16.650
m 0 0 l 90 0 l 90 260 l 0 260

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:16.650
<b>Liquid

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:14.120
Ichika-chan, huh? Oh, there she is.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.900
She's not answering.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.960
Ichika-san doesn't answer the phone 
unless you let it at least ring ten times.

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:28.780
Oh, she answered!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:30.560
Hello?

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:33.160
<i>Do you know what time it is? 
Have you no common sense?</i>

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:36.010
Let society teach you some 
common sense sometime.

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:37.170
Goodnight!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.290
Sorry, I think I made her mad.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:42.980
<b>Drunk Meter</b>

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:45.050
Oh, it's fine. That's how she always is.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.130
Always?! That's sort of 
amazing in a lot of ways.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.520
That didn't sound like his voice...

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:53.960
But whatever.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:00.980
Koikimo

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.990
Koikimo

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.990
Ruri
Favorite Food
Yokan

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.990
Satsuki
Favorite Food
Riceballs

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:08.990
<b>Culture Festival</b>

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.990
<b>The Sixteenth Night</b>

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:16.000
<b>Welcome School Festival</b>

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.690
Welcome!

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.130
<b>Japanese-Style</b>

00:14:19.230 --> 00:14:20.130
Excuse me.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:22.130
Could we get two bowls of ramen?

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.190
I'm terribly sorry,

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:26.510
but we're a Japanese-style café, 
so we don't have ramen.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.950
What? But ramen is Japanese.

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:31.070
Could we get a smile, then?

00:14:31.070 --> 00:14:33.430
Could you kindly pick 
something from the menu?

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.520
What? You're not gonna do it?

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:38.350
Then could you tell me your bra size?

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.730
Uh... could you just order?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.500
You dumbass.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:48.570
You know, if you're looking for ramen, 
they had some in 3-2.

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.230
Want me to show you the way?

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:51.900
Huh?

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:55.590
Also, if you guys haven't 
figured out what you want yet,

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:57.910
mind if we order first?

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.480
No?

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:02.150
G-Go ahead!

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:05.460
<b>Japanese-Style</b>

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.850
Were school desks always like this?

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:08.370
This takes me back.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:13.190
So where's your crush? I came 
here today just to see her.

00:15:13.190 --> 00:15:14.450
She's probably...

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.470
Rio.

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:17.500
Do you have enough sugar?

00:15:21.080 --> 00:15:24.410
Oh, I'm sorry. May I take your photo?

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:27.610
You seem to have the 
order backwards on that.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.850
So you really did show up.

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:34.980
Yep. I was going to come here 
no matter what it took.

00:15:34.980 --> 00:15:36.890
Somehow, I don't think you're joking.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:38.500
Oh, hello.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:42.630
Hello. I'm Ryo's buddy, Masuda.

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:44.720
I'm a freelance photographer and single.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:49.030
Um... I'm Ryo-san's little 
sister's friend, Arima Ichika.

00:15:49.030 --> 00:15:52.720
So this is <i>the</i> Ichika-chan? Ah, I see.

00:15:52.940 --> 00:15:53.940
"The"?

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:57.260
Hey, you're scaring Ichika-san. 
Stop staring at her.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.410
Ryo-san, what did you tell your friend?

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.100
Huh? Well, I...

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.840
Thank you for waiting!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:05.980
I just told him how much I lov—

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.480
Thank you for waiting! 
Here's your chiffon cake!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.090
Uh, Ichika-chan?

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.510
<i>That was close... Someone from 
my class almost heard him.</i>

00:16:14.510 --> 00:16:16.860
<i>Ichika-san basically just fed me.</i>

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:18.620
Delicious...

00:16:16.860 --> 00:16:18.620
Uh, are you okay?

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.460
Tamaru, you can go on break.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.950
Okay, thanks.

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:26.300
Hey, Rio's brother's here.

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.530
I-I'm going to go fix my hair.

00:16:28.530 --> 00:16:29.710
Me, too.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:31.230
Welcome.

00:16:31.230 --> 00:16:35.330
Hey, it's Rio-chan. It's been a 
while, huh? What, two years?

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.820
Who are you again?

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:39.100
You don't even remember me...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.640
I'm Ryo's friend from middle and high school.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.890
I think you had a fish in your name...

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:45.940
Do you remember me now?

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.030
Sakeda-san?

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:49.940
So you guessed Sake instead of Masu...

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.940
<b>Trout
(Masu)</b>

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.940
<b>Salmon
(Sake)</b>

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.120
You're not exactly wrong.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.060
Did you two already see 
the rest of the festival?

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:56.460
No, we're planning to look around after this.

00:16:57.420 --> 00:17:00.780
And now, we have a lot more to talk about.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.010
Ichika, don't you have 
a break coming up soon?

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:04.750
Huh?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.320
Could you show my brother around?

00:17:07.320 --> 00:17:08.570
Wait, me?

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.630
Please? I can't leave yet,

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.130
<b>Food Fighter Challenge</b>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.130
Finish in 20 minutes
<b>and get food free!!</b>

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.600
and Masuda-san wants to 
try this eating contest.

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:16.090
Huh? But I never sa—

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:17.260
But...

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.350
Ichika-san.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:21.660
I'm honored to have you guide me.

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:34.240
I hope this is clear, but stay at 
least three meters away from me.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:34.900
Sure.

00:17:34.910 --> 00:17:37.530
If you can't stick to that, 
I will make you go home.

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:41.540
Oh, you're so cold. 
Though that's also adorable...

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:43.610
No saying stuff like that, either!

00:17:43.610 --> 00:17:45.600
<i>Ryo-san stands out so much as it is.</i>

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:48.400
<i>I don't know what I'll do 
if a classmate sees us.</i>

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:53.380
<b>Haunted House</b>

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:51.740
Look, Ichika-san! A haunted house! 
Why don't we go in?

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:53.380
Feel free to go in on your own.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.670
Oh, I forgot to tell you.

00:17:56.670 --> 00:17:59.600
You in that kimono is even more— Oh, no!

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:01.780
I was about to compliment you again.

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:03.680
You're totally messing with me, aren't you?

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:05.470
Say, Rio-chan.

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:06.180
Yeah?

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:08.110
What's Ichika-chan like?

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:10.310
She's totally normal.

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:14.320
<b>Food Fighter Challenge</b>

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:13.120
And Ryo's got a crush on her, right?

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:14.320
Yeah.

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:18.040
I never would've believed she was 
really in the same grade as you.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.170
Ichika's a completely normal girl...

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:24.380
But I guess she's special to my brother.

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:27.460
Yeah.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:30.000
And you've only got ten minutes left.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.630
You've got this!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:37.090
I give up

00:18:32.480 --> 00:18:35.720
Yeah, no, I don't. Please let me go.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.090
m 0 0 l 380 0 l 380 85 l 0 85

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:37.090
Masuda spent the next 
2 hours eating all of the food.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:40.330
Hey, super-hot guy!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:43.000
Wanna give it a try?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:47.030
If you hit it in the middle, you get 
500 yen in vouchers for the food stalls!

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:49.050
If you get a bingo, you win even more!

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:52.310
Huh. And I can use this at any stall?

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:53.350
Yep!

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:55.030
Then I guess I'll try it once.

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.200
What? Wait, Ryo-san!

00:18:57.200 --> 00:18:59.350
Come on. I might as well, right?

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:05.160
<b>Strike Out!!</b>

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:05.160
You've got this!

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:08.760
Aw, so close!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:11.670
Nice!

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.020
This is actually pretty hard.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:15.910
Here you go, Ichika-san.

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:16.710
Huh?

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:21.000
I-I'm terrible at sports, though! I can't!

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.540
Oh, just give it a try.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.440
There!

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:31.690
Ow!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.250
Huh?

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:39.190
Ebisu 2nd High School Culture Festival

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:39.190
<b>yen</b>

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:45.920
It hit his head, then the ceiling... 
and then it hit dead center...

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.410
You're fantastic, Ichika-san.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:49.700
You're laughing too much!

00:19:50.070 --> 00:19:53.210
I feel bad enough for hitting that guy.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:58.250
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, 
I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.250
Nah, I'm glad you won.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.620
I can't... I just can't stop laughing.

00:20:01.620 --> 00:20:03.980
I haven't laughed this much in so long.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:09.930
Let's go eat something already, 
since we have these vouchers.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:13.700
Sure. I guess I am getting hungry.

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:15.860
And my break is—

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:19.300
Look out!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.200
A-Are you okay?

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.150
Are you hurt?

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:29.850
I-I'm okay...

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:32.700
That startled me...

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.890
Did you think I wouldn't notice?!

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.610
My body just reacted on its own.

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.100
How were you going to explain this 
to my friends if they saw you?!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.470
Why are you smirking?

00:20:57.010 --> 00:21:00.110
Oh, I'm sorry. This might be imprudent of me,

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:01.330
but I was so happy.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:06.980
Because this time, I was able 
to save you, Ichika-san.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:16.870
Grumble...

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:20.440
Even your tummy makes 
cute sounds, Ichika-san.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.380
I'm so done!

00:21:21.690 --> 00:21:24.190
I'll go get us something to eat.

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:26.650
Huh? No, I'll go with you.

00:21:27.060 --> 00:21:30.970
You're not used to walking in a kimono. 
We don't want you tripping again.

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:32.390
Okay?

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:33.220
But...

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:36.020
Now, now... Is there anything in 
particular that you want to eat?

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:38.500
Y-Yakisoba.

00:21:38.500 --> 00:21:39.530
All right.

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:44.150
Just wait for me in this empty classroom.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.620
I'll be right back.

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:15.460
Ryo-san smelled like cologne...

00:22:24.830 --> 00:22:26.360
That startled me...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.250
Next Time

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.250
"I'm Not Teasing You"

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:38.420
Next time, "I'm Not Teasing You."
